1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

2
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

3
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kaki narase sonzai wo</b></font></font></font>

4
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>rock away your existence</b></font></font></font>

5
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>koko ni iru to</b></font></font></font>

6
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>shouting that you are here</b></font></font></font>

7
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>arata na tabi ga ima hajimaru</b></font></font></font>

8
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>a new journey begins now</b></font></font></font>

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kawari yuku kisetsu no naka wo ikinuku tabi ni bokura</b></font></font></font>

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>as we survived through the changing seasons</b></font></font></font>

11
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>chie to tsuyosa wo te ni ireta kedo JUST LOOKS LIKE SURVIVAL GAME</b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we gained knowledge and strength (just looks like a survival game)</b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>nagareteku jikan no naka ni</b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but the forgotten memories</b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:44,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow. There's a lot of new houses
being built around here.</font>

32
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:46,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hear it's been a bit
of a construction boom recently.</font>

33
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:48,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seems like a lot of the construction sites
are short-handed</font>

34
00:01:48,790 --> 00:01:51,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and they're hiring carpenters
from outside of the country, too.</font>

35
00:01:52,210 --> 00:01:54,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even I know that.</font>

36
00:01:59,180 --> 00:02:00,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Old Man Genno!</font>

37
00:02:02,140 --> 00:02:03,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

38
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is he?</font>

39
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:07,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a carpenter from the Land of Sand.</font>

40
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:09,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He likes ramen, and we bump
into each other at Ichiraku.</font>

41
00:02:11,310 --> 00:02:13,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about we go there after this?</font>

42
00:02:14,860 --> 00:02:15,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

43
00:02:18,780 --> 00:02:20,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you go, thanks for waiting!</font>

44
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:21,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you for this meal!</font>

45
00:02:21,530 --> 00:02:22,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you.</font>

46
00:02:27,460 --> 00:02:30,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ichiraku's ramen is the best, after all!</font>

47
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:33,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it so? Isn't it so?</font>

48
00:02:34,050 --> 00:02:35,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, but can I have some water?</font>

49
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure!</font>

50
00:02:38,050 --> 00:02:40,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Thank you for this meal!
— That was fast!</font>

51
00:02:40,180 --> 00:02:42,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you full already?</font>

52
00:02:42,390 --> 00:02:44,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... Not really.</font>

53
00:02:45,260 --> 00:02:47,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll give you mine.</font>

54
00:02:47,980 --> 00:02:49,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lucky!</font>

55
00:02:50,350 --> 00:02:52,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto!</font>

56
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:54,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The two of them are always like this.</font>

57
00:02:54,940 --> 00:02:57,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They act as if they're really grandfather
and grandson.</font>

58
00:02:58,190 --> 00:03:00,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, come on, Sakura,
stop being so harsh.</font>

59
00:03:02,490 --> 00:03:05,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are lots of other people
who complain. Like Grandma Tsunade.</font>

60
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:07,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there's Shino, Ino, Kiba,
and Kakashi-sensei...</font>

61
00:03:07,750 --> 00:03:09,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I guess you're the harshest, Sakura.</font>

62
00:03:09,540 --> 00:03:10,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, Naruto!</font>

63
00:03:10,790 --> 00:03:12,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's only
because you're always at fault!</font>

64
00:03:12,750 --> 00:03:16,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, now, Sakura calm down.
You hair will turn grey... Ouch!</font>

65
00:03:16,670 --> 00:03:19,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like it's time I got to business.</font>

66
00:03:19,340 --> 00:03:22,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hey, hey.
— Help me, Old Man Genno!</font>

67
00:03:22,970 --> 00:03:27,850
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">A Tough Pinch!</font>

68
00:03:22,970 --> 00:03:27,850
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Hidden Leaf 11 All Gather</font>

69
00:03:43,610 --> 00:03:44,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

70
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:48,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it? Fog?</font>

71
00:03:51,910 --> 00:03:54,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I guess it doesn't matter.</font>

72
00:04:10,810 --> 00:04:11,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama.</font>

73
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:15,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry to bother you
during your sleep,</font>

74
00:04:15,190 --> 00:04:17,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but the man that the ANBU Black Ops
had marked...</font>

75
00:04:18,780 --> 00:04:19,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Has made his move?</font>

76
00:04:20,440 --> 00:04:22,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is currently on the run.</font>

77
00:04:22,860 --> 00:04:23,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On the run?</font>

78
00:04:24,610 --> 00:04:26,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you telling me even
with the array of the ANBU Black Ops,</font>

79
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:27,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we still can't catch him?</font>

80
00:04:28,450 --> 00:04:30,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is he?</font>

81
00:04:30,910 --> 00:04:32,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must know his identity by now.</font>

82
00:04:33,750 --> 00:04:35,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There was nobody
in the recent Bingo Book</font>

83
00:04:35,420 --> 00:04:37,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that fit his description,</font>

84
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:40,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but when we checked
an older Bingo Book...</font>

85
00:04:44,930 --> 00:04:45,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genno?</font>

86
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:48,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genno the Trapper?</font>

87
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know of him?</font>

88
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:52,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He should be quite old by now.</font>

89
00:04:53,270 --> 00:04:54,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hadn't heard his name in a while,</font>

90
00:04:55,060 --> 00:04:56,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so I thought
that he had already retired, but...</font>

91
00:04:59,610 --> 00:05:02,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never would have thought
that he was infiltrating the Leaf Village.</font>

92
00:05:07,660 --> 00:05:10,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess I can't fight against old age.</font>

93
00:05:12,410 --> 00:05:17,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. I guess I should say this is just
what I expect of the Leaf ANBU Black Ops.</font>

94
00:05:24,050 --> 00:05:27,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We want you to hand over the thing you
took from the master carpenter's house.</font>

95
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:31,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You think I would still be holding
onto that thing?</font>

96
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've had a long life as a Shinobi.</font>

97
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:38,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess it wouldn't be so bad
to close the curtain at this time.</font>

98
00:05:38,730 --> 00:05:41,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though I regret
that I won't be able to see</font>

99
00:05:41,230 --> 00:05:42,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the end of the Leaf Village
with my own eyes!</font>

100
00:05:44,610 --> 00:05:45,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Paper Bombs!</font>

101
00:05:45,650 --> 00:05:46,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Retreat!</font>

102
00:06:32,990 --> 00:06:34,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you saying that someone</font>

103
00:06:34,330 --> 00:06:37,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is planning a huge attack
against the Leaf Village?!</font>

104
00:06:38,250 --> 00:06:41,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That would be the only reason
anyone would want those plans,</font>

105
00:06:41,710 --> 00:06:43,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">aside from carpentry purposes.</font>

106
00:06:44,500 --> 00:06:47,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genno's last words suggest that as well.</font>

107
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:51,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's going to take some time
to decipher those plans,</font>

108
00:06:51,090 --> 00:06:53,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it's too dangerous to depend on that.</font>

109
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:56,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The enemy may attack us
at any minute.</font>

110
00:06:58,060 --> 00:07:01,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Activate the S-Level Emergency
Security Alert!</font>

111
00:07:03,230 --> 00:07:05,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave the least amount
of men necessary here,</font>

112
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:07,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and all other men are to secure
the border!</font>

113
00:07:08,570 --> 00:07:12,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Attack anyone who tries to cross
the border!</font>

114
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:15,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't allow them to attack the village,
no matter what!</font>

115
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:23,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such great weather!</font>

116
00:07:23,170 --> 00:07:24,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

117
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:26,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Sakura!</font>

118
00:07:28,210 --> 00:07:30,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That sounds like a big pain in the ass.</font>

119
00:07:31,050 --> 00:07:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think you'll be able to do it.
That is why we left you in the village.</font>

120
00:07:36,970 --> 00:07:39,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the very least, is there any way
that we can get more people?</font>

121
00:07:40,690 --> 00:07:44,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Under these circumstances,
we can't turn over more people to you.</font>

122
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:46,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're the greatest lineup for you,
aren't they?</font>

123
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:49,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The greatest, huh?</font>

124
00:07:53,950 --> 00:07:57,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fog? Last night's weather didn't seem
like it was going to be foggy.</font>

125
00:07:58,830 --> 00:08:02,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How strange.....
Was it all a dream?</font>

126
00:08:07,420 --> 00:08:10,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Doesn't it seem like
we're really low on people?</font>

127
00:08:10,460 --> 00:08:11,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I was thinking, too.</font>

128
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From the looks of it,</font>

129
00:08:14,010 --> 00:08:16,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the village must be
under special security alert.</font>

130
00:08:16,640 --> 00:08:20,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! For real?!
I didn't notice it!</font>

131
00:08:20,980 --> 00:08:23,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should notice these kinds of things.
You're a Ninja.</font>

132
00:08:23,770 --> 00:08:26,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if we're in a state of emergency,</font>

133
00:08:26,150 --> 00:08:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's a huge deal for the village,
isn't it?</font>

134
00:08:27,610 --> 00:08:30,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why haven't they told us anything?</font>

135
00:08:30,570 --> 00:08:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why Tsunade-sama is calling us.</font>

136
00:08:36,490 --> 00:08:37,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come in.</font>

137
00:08:38,530 --> 00:08:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama, I brought Naruto.</font>

138
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru.</font>

139
00:08:46,210 --> 00:08:48,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, you must have been left out, too.</font>

140
00:08:50,050 --> 00:08:51,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you taking about?</font>

141
00:08:52,210 --> 00:08:53,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing.</font>

142
00:08:53,470 --> 00:08:57,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, hey, Shikamaru.
About last night's weird fog...</font>

143
00:08:57,300 --> 00:08:58,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you see it?</font>

144
00:08:58,800 --> 00:09:01,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it. You were just dreaming.</font>

145
00:09:01,520 --> 00:09:03,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There was no fog.</font>

146
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:04,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See. I told you.</font>

147
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was a smoke screen.</font>

148
00:09:07,350 --> 00:09:08,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Smoke screen?</font>

149
00:09:09,070 --> 00:09:10,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll explain once everyone gets here.</font>

150
00:09:12,530 --> 00:09:13,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, Sakura...</font>

151
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason why we left you out</font>

152
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:18,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of the S-Level Emergency
Security Alert unit</font>

153
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:20,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is because we wanted you
to work under Shikamaru</font>

154
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for a special mission.</font>

155
00:09:21,410 --> 00:09:24,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?
— Well, that's the case.</font>

156
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:27,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, I want you to gather
the people I'm about to name.</font>

157
00:09:48,980 --> 00:09:51,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, calm down, Naruto!</font>

158
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:53,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's already past the time
we were supposed to gather!</font>

159
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:57,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not quite. To be accurate,
we still have 20 more seconds.</font>

160
00:10:01,950 --> 00:10:03,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seems like he's here.</font>

161
00:10:07,210 --> 00:10:10,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh? Everyone's already here?</font>

162
00:10:10,670 --> 00:10:13,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how you look at it,
you're the last one!</font>

163
00:10:14,260 --> 00:10:17,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone's here now. Let's begin.</font>

164
00:10:17,590 --> 00:10:19,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure
that you all have already noticed.</font>

165
00:10:19,510 --> 00:10:23,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The village is currently under
the S-Level Emergency Security Alert.</font>

166
00:10:24,010 --> 00:10:25,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It all started when...</font>

167
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:27,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The smoke screen last night, right?</font>

168
00:10:27,940 --> 00:10:30,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You guys noticed it?
— Of course.</font>

169
00:10:31,150 --> 00:10:33,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The bugs were being noisy.</font>

170
00:10:33,730 --> 00:10:36,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? I didn't notice it.</font>

171
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:38,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're always so out of it!</font>

172
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:40,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't notice it either.</font>

173
00:10:40,070 --> 00:10:42,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}{"SAME LEVEL AS CHOJI!
WORSE THAN NARUTO!"</b></font>

174
00:10:41,950 --> 00:10:44,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that I'm worse than Naruto?</font>

175
00:10:42,950 --> 00:10:46,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"WORSE THAN NARUTO"</b></font>

176
00:10:44,030 --> 00:10:46,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Worse than Naruto...
Worse than Naruto... Worse than Naruto...</font>

177
00:10:46,750 --> 00:10:49,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, what was that?</font>

178
00:10:49,710 --> 00:10:51,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seemed like something
involving the ANBU Black Ops.</font>

179
00:10:52,040 --> 00:10:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, I stayed put.</font>

180
00:10:53,380 --> 00:10:56,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, that's correct.
The ANBU Black Ops were involved.</font>

181
00:10:57,210 --> 00:10:58,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I thought.</font>

182
00:10:59,010 --> 00:11:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was late last night.</font>

183
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:04,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A man that the ANBU Black Ops had
been marking for the past two weeks</font>

184
00:11:04,970 --> 00:11:07,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">had snuck into the home
of Leaf Village's top carpentry boss.</font>

185
00:11:09,810 --> 00:11:15,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he stole the plans of our village's
important facilities from the secret safe.</font>

186
00:11:16,190 --> 00:11:17,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Plans...?</font>

187
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:19,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, what's so bad about that?</font>

188
00:11:19,900 --> 00:11:22,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He just stole the plans
for the facilities, right?</font>

189
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:25,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just stole? You're so...</font>

190
00:11:26,540 --> 00:11:27,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

191
00:11:28,790 --> 00:11:31,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For example, let's say the plans
for the fort that surrounds the village</font>

192
00:11:31,580 --> 00:11:32,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">fell into enemy hands...</font>

193
00:11:34,540 --> 00:11:37,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By analyzing those plans in detail,</font>

194
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:39,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the enemy could figure out
the most efficient way</font>

195
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:41,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to break into the village.</font>

196
00:11:44,260 --> 00:11:46,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now let's say that there were plans
for Tsunade-sama's mansion.</font>

197
00:11:47,260 --> 00:11:48,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you were to examine those plans,</font>

198
00:11:48,430 --> 00:11:52,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you could find out how to get
into Tsunade-sama's room.</font>

199
00:11:52,900 --> 00:11:55,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if the plans were to get
into the hands of an assassin...</font>

200
00:11:55,860 --> 00:11:59,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's really, really bad.</font>

201
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:02,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Last night's smoke screen was...</font>

202
00:12:02,450 --> 00:12:05,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">something that suspect spread
as he was running away.</font>

203
00:12:05,910 --> 00:12:06,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

204
00:12:06,990 --> 00:12:10,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the end, ANBU Black Ops cornered him
in the Western Forest.</font>

205
00:12:11,710 --> 00:12:13,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He killed himself
before they could get him to talk.</font>

206
00:12:17,590 --> 00:12:20,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unfortunately,
when he committed suicide,</font>

207
00:12:20,760 --> 00:12:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he wasn't in possession of the plans
he had stolen.</font>

208
00:12:24,050 --> 00:12:26,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the plans have already fallen
into the hands of the enemy,</font>

209
00:12:28,310 --> 00:12:30,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it'd be a re-enactment of the nightmare
of the Destruction of Leaf Village.</font>

210
00:12:31,930 --> 00:12:33,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to prevent that from happening,</font>

211
00:12:33,730 --> 00:12:36,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the S-Level Emergency Security Alert
was deployed this morning.</font>

212
00:12:37,110 --> 00:12:39,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, what is the mission
for those of us left behind?</font>

213
00:12:40,820 --> 00:12:44,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Find out the location of the stolen plans
and bring them back.</font>

214
00:12:44,570 --> 00:12:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's our mission.</font>

215
00:12:46,660 --> 00:12:48,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's like finding a needle in a haystack.</font>

216
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:51,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We just need to investigate
the path he took</font>

217
00:12:51,410 --> 00:12:53,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and people he was acquainted with.</font>

218
00:12:54,210 --> 00:12:58,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It turns out that the guy was famous
for being a top-level trap technician.</font>

219
00:12:59,210 --> 00:13:02,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a huge possibility
that he left traps where the plans are.</font>

220
00:13:03,670 --> 00:13:05,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's definitely plausible.</font>

221
00:13:06,140 --> 00:13:09,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand.
We'll follow your instructions.</font>

222
00:13:09,430 --> 00:13:11,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do it.</font>

223
00:13:13,020 --> 00:13:14,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then let's start the investigation.</font>

224
00:13:15,890 --> 00:13:19,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Turns out that the man had snuck
into the village</font>

225
00:13:19,230 --> 00:13:21,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a few months ago
and worked as a carpenter.</font>

226
00:13:25,650 --> 00:13:27,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...</font>

227
00:13:28,820 --> 00:13:31,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His name is... Genno.</font>

228
00:13:34,910 --> 00:13:36,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're kidding me.</font>

229
00:13:42,500 --> 00:13:48,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way! Old Man Genno loved
the ramen at Ichiraku!</font>

230
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:53,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He would never do anything that would
destroy the Hidden Leaf Village!</font>

231
00:13:53,930 --> 00:13:57,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen, there's no way that a guy
who's sneaking in to an enemy village</font>

232
00:13:57,140 --> 00:13:59,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would show his bad side.</font>

233
00:13:59,940 --> 00:14:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He played the part of a good guy
to let people's guard down.</font>

234
00:14:03,900 --> 00:14:05,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no way that anyone
who loves ramen could be a bad person!</font>

235
00:14:06,820 --> 00:14:09,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. That's not true Naruto.</font>

236
00:14:09,910 --> 00:14:13,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji, you tell him.
Knock some sense into this guy.</font>

237
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:17,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyone who loves Ichiraku's ramen
can't be a bad person!</font>

238
00:14:18,210 --> 00:14:19,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji!</font>

239
00:14:20,130 --> 00:14:22,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gosh, I can't depend on anybody.</font>

240
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:27,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a list of the stolen plans.</font>

241
00:14:29,010 --> 00:14:32,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm so embarrassed
we lost our important plans.</font>

242
00:14:33,430 --> 00:14:35,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't show my face to Tsunade-sama.</font>

243
00:14:37,980 --> 00:14:40,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which construction jobs
were Genno involved with?</font>

244
00:14:41,150 --> 00:14:42,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">None of them.</font>

245
00:14:43,520 --> 00:14:45,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But wasn't he working under you?</font>

246
00:14:46,490 --> 00:14:49,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't allow outsiders to work
on any construction</font>

247
00:14:49,450 --> 00:14:51,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that involves the safety of the village.</font>

248
00:14:51,870 --> 00:14:56,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That old man only worked
on residential construction.</font>

249
00:14:56,830 --> 00:14:57,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which means...</font>

250
00:14:58,040 --> 00:15:01,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's little possibility that he snuck
some traps into the construction.</font>

251
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:03,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think it's impossible.</font>

252
00:15:04,040 --> 00:15:06,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should check everything,
just in case.</font>

253
00:15:07,460 --> 00:15:08,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm counting on you.</font>

254
00:15:09,300 --> 00:15:11,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Hinata, please take care of these.</font>

255
00:15:12,930 --> 00:15:14,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

256
00:15:15,220 --> 00:15:17,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I'll go, too.
— Me, too.</font>

257
00:15:23,730 --> 00:15:25,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mentioned it earlier,
but there is a possibility</font>

258
00:15:25,270 --> 00:15:28,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that the plans haven't fallen
into the enemy's hands yet.</font>

259
00:15:28,570 --> 00:15:32,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's possible that he could have hidden it
while he was running away.</font>

260
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:36,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it's our mission to find that.</font>

261
00:15:37,040 --> 00:15:38,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Understood.</font>

262
00:15:43,540 --> 00:15:46,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the start of a treasure hunt.
I'm depending on you, Akamaru.</font>

263
00:15:49,880 --> 00:15:50,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

264
00:16:02,520 --> 00:16:05,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino and Sakura, you guys go check
the old man's body.</font>

265
00:16:06,230 --> 00:16:08,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There might be some clues.</font>

266
00:16:09,150 --> 00:16:11,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Us?</font>

267
00:16:11,950 --> 00:16:12,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got it.</font>

268
00:16:13,660 --> 00:16:17,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! You just want me to go, right?!
I'll go!</font>

269
00:16:19,660 --> 00:16:22,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, are you really okay with this?</font>

270
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:25,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to be. I'm training
to become a Medical Ninja.</font>

271
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:27,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't be afraid of something like this.</font>

272
00:16:28,250 --> 00:16:30,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That might be the case for you, but...</font>

273
00:16:33,510 --> 00:16:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now... master carpenter.</font>

274
00:16:36,430 --> 00:16:41,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you tell us everything you know
about Old Man Genno?</font>

275
00:16:44,140 --> 00:16:48,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The old man came to Leaf Village
about three months ago.</font>

276
00:16:49,190 --> 00:16:51,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He came to my place
with a recommendation letter</font>

277
00:16:51,610 --> 00:16:54,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from a famous master carpenter
from the Land of Sand.</font>

278
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:56,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you may already know,</font>

279
00:16:56,490 --> 00:16:59,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's a bit of a construction boom
in Leaf Village.</font>

280
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:03,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Every place is in need of more people.</font>

281
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:05,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And we needed more hands ourselves,</font>

282
00:17:05,750 --> 00:17:07,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so we decided to hire him right away.</font>

283
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:10,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His carpeting skills...
were all right, just average.</font>

284
00:17:11,710 --> 00:17:14,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't feel the urge
to hire him permanently,</font>

285
00:17:14,340 --> 00:17:16,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">nor did I feel like I wanted
to fire him right away.</font>

286
00:17:18,010 --> 00:17:19,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He took his job seriously.</font>

287
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:23,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was perfect to hire
when we were short on people.</font>

288
00:17:25,140 --> 00:17:26,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But after a while,</font>

289
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:30,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found out that the recommendation letter
he brought was a fake.</font>

290
00:17:31,780 --> 00:17:33,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the recommendation letter
he brought.</font>

291
00:17:36,410 --> 00:17:38,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And how is this a fake?</font>

292
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:42,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There was a guy who brought
a recommendation letter</font>

293
00:17:42,910 --> 00:17:45,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from the same master carpenter
more than ten years ago.</font>

294
00:17:45,830 --> 00:17:48,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just happened to find
that recommendation letter,</font>

295
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:52,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so I compared it and I noticed
that the handwriting was different.</font>

296
00:17:53,380 --> 00:17:54,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that recommendation letter?</font>

297
00:17:55,420 --> 00:17:57,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over there in that cabinet.</font>

298
00:18:00,260 --> 00:18:04,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh? Where did I put it?
I know I put it here.</font>

299
00:18:05,020 --> 00:18:06,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay if you don't have it.</font>

300
00:18:07,310 --> 00:18:08,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry.</font>

301
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:14,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For us, we really didn't care
if his recommendation letter was a fake</font>

302
00:18:14,570 --> 00:18:17,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as long as he didn't do anything bad.</font>

303
00:18:18,490 --> 00:18:23,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just thought that I should let things
like this be known to Tsunade-sama.</font>

304
00:18:25,660 --> 00:18:27,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think
that the old man was</font>

305
00:18:27,290 --> 00:18:30,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a Shinobi from another country
and that he would steal our plans.</font>

306
00:18:31,840 --> 00:18:35,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I still can't believe it.</font>

307
00:18:36,010 --> 00:18:39,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, is it really
that old man's doing?</font>

308
00:18:40,590 --> 00:18:43,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe it either.</font>

309
00:18:46,810 --> 00:18:49,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are no signs of traps.</font>

310
00:18:55,570 --> 00:18:56,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

311
00:19:00,660 --> 00:19:02,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is where the old man lived, huh?</font>

312
00:19:03,240 --> 00:19:05,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He always paid the rent on time.</font>

313
00:19:07,540 --> 00:19:09,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He really was quite proper.</font>

314
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:13,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once in a while he'd come home
after drinking with his carpenter friends,</font>

315
00:19:13,750 --> 00:19:16,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but he would never cause trouble.</font>

316
00:19:16,840 --> 00:19:21,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I did predict it,
but there are no clues.</font>

317
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:23,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I found it!
— What did you find?</font>

318
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:29,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A special bonito broth, refreshing udon
and light broth super thin udon!</font>

319
00:19:30,190 --> 00:19:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're not looking for food!</font>

320
00:19:32,520 --> 00:19:35,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, usually,
if somebody is living by himself,</font>

321
00:19:35,400 --> 00:19:38,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he'd probably stock up
on a bit more food.</font>

322
00:19:38,110 --> 00:19:39,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's only instant-cup udon.</font>

323
00:19:40,530 --> 00:19:45,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't he eat out a lot?
I hear that he went to Ichiraku a lot.</font>

324
00:19:46,080 --> 00:19:47,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right, Naruto?</font>

325
00:19:48,080 --> 00:19:49,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

326
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:52,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he cooked himself, he could have
eaten more and saved money.</font>

327
00:19:52,790 --> 00:19:55,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji, we're not talking about you.</font>

328
00:20:06,430 --> 00:20:10,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That old man barely talked about himself.</font>

329
00:20:10,350 --> 00:20:11,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I expected.</font>

330
00:20:12,690 --> 00:20:14,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But he did happily talk about</font>

331
00:20:14,310 --> 00:20:18,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">how he became friends
with one of the kids in the village.</font>

332
00:20:19,280 --> 00:20:22,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He might have heard something
from the old man.</font>

333
00:20:22,990 --> 00:20:25,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I wonder about that.</font>

334
00:20:25,530 --> 00:20:27,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean,
you wonder about that?</font>

335
00:20:27,240 --> 00:20:30,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We won't know until we find the kid
and question him, won't we?</font>

336
00:20:30,790 --> 00:20:34,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it seems like there's no need for us
to look for him or question him.</font>

337
00:20:35,130 --> 00:20:37,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Then where is this guy!</font>

338
00:20:38,380 --> 00:20:42,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot, that kid is you, Naruto!</font>

339
00:20:42,720 --> 00:20:45,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Me?!</font>

340
00:20:45,510 --> 00:20:47,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, there's no mistake about that.</font>

341
00:20:47,760 --> 00:20:49,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're Uzumaki Naruto?</font>

342
00:20:52,480 --> 00:20:55,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We want to talk to you for a bit.</font>

343
00:21:29,780 --> 00:21:32,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">hoshikuzu suchasucha sucha odoru</font></font></b></font></font>

