<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">but more importantly, the fuzziness I feel in my undeveloped chest,</font></font></b></font></font>

359
00:22:05,150 --> 00:22:12,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">nonda koora no sei kashira nee</font></font></b></font></font>

360
00:22:05,150 --> 00:22:12,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">I wonder If it's from that coke I just drank?</font></font></b></font></font>

361
00:22:39,580 --> 00:22:42,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I wonder what kind of interrogation
Naruto is undergoing?</font>

362
00:22:42,630 --> 00:22:45,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I guess they would use
Regressive Hypnosis or something.</font>

363
00:22:45,170 --> 00:22:46,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What's Regressive Hypnosis?</font>

364
00:22:46,460 --> 00:22:49,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It's a Jutsu to draw out
subconscious memories.</font>

365
00:22:50,390 --> 00:22:53,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Then Naruto might know something
even with his bad memory.</font>

366
00:22:54,430 --> 00:22:55,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Hmm. I wonder about that.</font>

367
00:22:55,470 --> 00:22:58,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Well, this Old Man Genno sounds
like he was pretty tricky...</font>

368
00:22:58,850 --> 00:23:00,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Walt, why are you here anyway?</font>

369
00:23:01,100 --> 00:23:03,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
